{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929810/extras/a86fc8407779a95d2eb5addbb553c983.poster.avif?t=1757572235\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929810/extras/a86fc8407779a95d2eb5addbb553c983.webm?t=1757572235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929810/extras/a86fc8407779a95d2eb5addbb553c983.mp4?t=1757572235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Reclaim the soul of a fallen kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Queen Soul is a third-person action RPG set in a war-torn, visually stunning world. Step into the role of a nameless warrior as you shape your identity, raise a stronghold, and battle through hostile lands to uncover the truth behind the Queen\u2019s disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Core Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Creation \u2013 Customize your appearance and build your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Your Castle \u2013 Rebuild and expand your stronghold as a base of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-Time Action Combat \u2013 Engage in fast-paced battles with fluid movement and realistic animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A World in Ruin \u2013 Explore detailed environments crafted with realism and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle brings you closer to the heart of a mystery. The Queen\u2019s soul still lingers\u2014but so do the forces that destroyed her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929810/extras/51ffb819a171b67ebf0e3fcdc0a140bc.poster.avif?t=1757572235\" width=750 height=422 ><source sr